        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Perception - Cognitive Science",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**The two-stream hypothesis** (Ungerleider & Mishkin 1982; Milner & Goodale 1992 revision):"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-PERCEPTION.md#010",
      "path": [
        "01-PERCEPTION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:cognitive-science:01-perception, git-history:cognitive-science:01-perception]",
        "canonical_path": "cognitive-science/01-PERCEPTION.md",
        "concepts": "[perception]",
        "current_path": "cognitive-science/01-PERCEPTION.md",
        "id": "maxim:cognitive-science:perception",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "cognitive-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[perception]",
        "section": "cognitive-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Perception - Cognitive Science",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "| Stream | Pathway | Function | Lesion effect |\n|--------|---------|----------|---------------|\n| **Ventral** | V1 → V4 → IT (inferotemporal) | Object recognition, identity | Visual agnosia (can't name objects) |\n| **Dorsal** | V1 → MT → parietal | Spatial, action guidance | Optic ataxia (can't reach accurately) |"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-PERCEPTION.md#011",
      "path": [
        "01-PERCEPTION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:cognitive-science:01-perception, git-history:cognitive-science:01-perception]",
        "canonical_path": "cognitive-science/01-PERCEPTION.md",
        "concepts": "[perception]",
        "current_path": "cognitive-science/01-PERCEPTION.md",
        "id": "maxim:cognitive-science:perception",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "cognitive-science",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[perception]",
        "section": "cognitive-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Perception - Cognitive Science",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Key: Goodale & Milner's revision** — it's not \"what\" vs \"where\" but \"what\" vs \"how.\" Patient D.F. had ventral stream damage: couldn't recognize object orientation, but when asked to *post a letter* through a slot, her hand rotated correctly. Perception for recognition vs. perception for action dissociate."
    },
    {
      "id": "01-PERCEPTION.md#012",
      "path": [
        "01-PERCEPTION.md"
