      "text": "CONTINUITY         FIGURE-GROUND      COMMON FATE\n  ─────────          ####.....          * * * * →  these dots\n  ─────────          ####.....          * * * * →  moving together\n  Lines seen as       Which region       are grouped\n  continuous, not     is \"figure\"?       together\n  broken              (Rubin vase)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-PERCEPTION.md#020",
      "path": [
        "01-PERCEPTION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
